     DBEA             (    forth6809.asm):01781         BASELATEST  EQU   H_BACKSLASH         ; head of the ROM dictionary (see COLD). See shadow BASELATEST.2
                      (    forth6809.asm):01782         
                      (    forth6809.asm):01783         ; Verify no collision with base code.
