E5D8 DC1F             (    forth6809.asm):04198         RECURSEW:   LDD   CURXT             ; xt of word being compiled
E5DA 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04199                     PSHU  D                 ; See bugfix: RECURSEW.1
E5DC BDE85D           (    forth6809.asm):04200                     JSR   CCALL
