                      (    forth6809.asm):06629         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
F23B 3710             (    forth6809.asm):06630         TWOSTOREW:  PULU  X                 ; a-addr
F23D 3706             (    forth6809.asm):06631                     PULU  D                 ; x2
